      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Some avatars animation settings can get broken with some chairs. I found also out not all chair scripts breaks the avatar animation.\nMight try find out which chair scripts are good and which can affect the avatar animation.\nIt really depends which avatar you use. (due different animation configs in each avatar)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
