  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-09-13T00:56:24.651Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Repro:\n1. Set up basic avatar in unity\n2. Apply one of the example sitting layers to the avatar descriptor.\n3. Test in game\n4. Sit in chair\n5. Leave chair\nExpected Result:\nTracking control resets to \"tracking\" (as set in controller)\nSitting layer goes back to zero weight.\nActual Result: \nTracking control briefly restores then immediately goes back to \"animation\" for Head, hands, hip, and feet. The Sitting layer blends to zero then immediately goes back to 1.00.\nYou must reset or change the avatar in order to restore tracking. It cannot be overridden by any other Tracking Control behavior.\nUsing VRCSDK3-AVATAR-2021.08.11.15.16_Public",
